+// ─── 6. Trussbars VM (dynamic backend, docs/11) ───────────────────────────────
+// The SAME MaxBars language as the AOT column, run through the dynamic tree-walk
+// interpreter instead of compiled to Rust. Like handlebars, the template is parsed
